  "problems": "Clothing, Denim and Swimwear accordions show identical body tables; Denim is sized by EU number, not waist inches. Letters span two EU sizes (XS = 32/34, S = 36/38, M = 40/42; L = 44 only). The 'size converter' view publishes UK/IT/FR-ES per letter as ranges (e.g. XS: UK 4-6, IT 36-38, FR/ES 34-36); those ranges are stored unsplit on both EU rows of each letter. Bust column labelled 'Chest'. Inseam 79 for every size. Chart tops out at EU 44."
